{"id":"vod_lz_43381","vodId":"43381","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"四月是你的谎言","name_cn":"四月是你的谎言","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20221214-1/00182a9db9b49e8296f589bb8df4883f.jpg"},"summary":"从很小的时候起，在母亲的引导和教导下，有马公生（花江夏树 配音）便将成为优秀的钢琴师当做了自己的毕生理想，一路走来，亦斩获了不少佳绩。不幸的是，在11岁那年，有马的母亲去世了，而有马亦再也无法听见自己所演奏的琴声，如此一来，他同自己最初的梦想渐行渐远。　　在念初三那年，一位名叫宫园薰（种田梨沙 配音）的女生出现在了有马的身边，薰演奏的乐器是小提琴。很快，有马便被薰身上所散发出来的才情和热情所吸引了。让有马没有想到的是，薰竟然指定有马成为她比赛中的伴奏，在薰的影响下，有马渐渐重燃了对于钢琴的热爱，他和薰之间的距离也因此越来越近。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-12-14 19:59:45","playable":true,"episodeCount":22,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221213/36209_9b77c41e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221213/36210_fc44b677/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221213/36211_923a6654/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221213/36212_73645cb7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221213/36213_97ecf110/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221213/36214_976dec6f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221213/36215_330bb28c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221213/36216_5a401428/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221213/36217_44539c60/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221213/36218_ba710736/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221213/36219_44794665/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221213/36220_1777d971/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221213/36221_696b96f1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221213/36222_f0ee2cb1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https